message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "ARGus — Agentic Rule-Grounded Screening"
abstract: >-
  An auditable framework for image-based regulatory compliance screening
  against complex rule sets: a bounded retrieval agent proposes candidate rules
  and a rule-grounded verdict keeps every decision traceable to a clause.
